    "abstract": "This submission improves Lax195003: for graphs with linear neighborhood complexity, a randomized word-RAM program computes Welzl orders with crossing number $O_c(\\log n)$ in near-linear time.\n\nThe theorem keeps the program black-box; its supporting concepts and concrete construction belong in the proof section.\n"
  },
